<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="skills_diagram.py" version="24.7.7" type="device">
  <diagram id="page1" name="Skills map">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2240" pageHeight="4959" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="p1_title" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Skills map — who owns each skill, how they connect, and what runs them&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1a1a1a;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1600" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_sub" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#666666;&quot;&gt;Generated by integrations/crew/skills_diagram.py from plugins/*/skills, commands, agents and plugin.json, and team.json — edit those, not this file.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="56" width="1900" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Left: the plugin&amp;#x27;s commands (what you type). Fill = the model its frontmatter pins; the line under the name = model · effort.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Middle (amber): the plugin&amp;#x27;s skills. A skill has no model of its own — it runs on the model of the command or session that loads it. Amber arrow: the command loads that skill.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Right (dashed): subagents, each on its own pinned model. Grey dashed arrow: the skill or command spawns it, in a fresh context.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#x27;hands off to / uses&amp;#x27; = other skills a skill sends work to or reads; &amp;#x27;(shared)&amp;#x27; = from plugins/_shared, bundled into the plugin.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Green frame: crew plugin (team.json crew). Grey frame: Captain-only.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#8e44ad;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■ Opus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#3c6fd1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■ Sonnet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#2e8b57;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■ Haiku&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#c2185b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■ Fable&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#8a8a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■ No pin: session model&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#c8c8c8;fontColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="2160" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_frame" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2e8b57;fontColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="305" width="1060" height="929" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_head" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Developer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#555555;&quot;&gt;Developer · developer v0.7.1 · Crew · the crew-workflow skill routes work to it&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="52" y="315" width="1036" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:bisect&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · high&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Find the commit that introduced a regression by bisecting a scripted reproduction, then read the culprit.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="372" width="290" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:diagnose&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · high&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Diagnose a bug down to its root cause — reproduce it, narrow it, prove the mechanism — without changing code.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="465" width="290" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:fix&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · high&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Implement a fix for a bug whose root cause is already proved, with the failing test written first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#5c3d00;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;also loads: test-driven-development (shared)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="557" width="290" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:implement&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · high&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Implement a feature, ticket or fix end to end — orient, plan, build in slices, verify with the repo&amp;#x27;s own…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#5c3d00;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;also loads: test-driven-development (shared)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="649" width="290" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:refactor&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · high&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Restructure existing code without changing behaviour — pin it with tests, find every caller, then apply…&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="754" width="290" height="69" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:resolve-conflicts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · medium&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Resolve a PR&amp;#x27;s merge conflicts by rebasing it onto its base branch, then re-run the checks and push with…&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="833" width="290" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:ship&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · medium&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Ship a finished change for review — ticket on a board, branch, commit, push, PR, card moved to In review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#5c3d00;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;also loads: ticket-management (shared)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="925" width="290" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:tdd&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · high&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Build one behaviour, or a short list of them, test-first — red, green, refactor — with each step checked by…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#5c3d00;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;also loads: test-driven-development (shared)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1030" width="290" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_c8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;/developer:verify&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · medium&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Run the checks this repository actually declares — types, lint, tests, build — and report what failed and why.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1135" width="290" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_s0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;regression-triage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Finds the change that broke something that used to work — establishes a last known good state, scripts a pass/fail verdict, drives git bisect to the…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#5c3d00;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hands off to / uses: root-cause-analysis&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d08a00;fontColor=#5c3d00;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="372" width="360" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_s1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;root-cause-analysis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Diagnoses a failure down to its mechanism before changing any code — reproduce it deterministically, narrow it to the smallest failing case, prove…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#5c3d00;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hands off to / uses: regression-triage&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d08a00;fontColor=#5c3d00;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="464" width="360" height="82" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_s2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feature-implementation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Implements a feature or fix end to end — orient in the existing code, agree a change plan, build it in slices that stay green, verify with the…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#5c3d00;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hands off to / uses: test-driven-development (shared), safe-refactoring&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#777777;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;used by skills of: crew-workflow (_shared)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d08a00;fontColor=#5c3d00;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="555" width="360" height="107" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_s3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;safe-refactoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Changes the shape of existing code without changing its behaviour — pin the current behaviour in tests, find every caller, then apply small…&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d08a00;fontColor=#5c3d00;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="672" width="360" height="69" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_s4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;merge-conflict-resolution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Resolves a pull request&amp;#x27;s merge conflicts, only when the user asked for it or gave permission, by rebasing the PR branch onto its base branch — each…&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d08a00;fontColor=#5c3d00;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="751" width="360" height="69" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_s5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ship-change&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;Ships a finished, verified change for review — files a GitHub issue on the board the user picks (or reuses the existing ticket the work is for),…&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#5c3d00;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hands off to / uses: ticket-management (shared), merge-conflict-resolution&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#777777;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;used by skills of: ci-setup (devops)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d08a00;fontColor=#5c3d00;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="830" width="360" height="107" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_a0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#777777;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;subagent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;implementer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · medium&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="372" width="240" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_developer_a1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#777777;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;subagent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;&gt;investigator&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#4a1f63;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opus 5.5 · high&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8fd;strokeColor=#8e44ad;fontColor=#4a1f63;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;fontFamily=Inter;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="438" width="240" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
